<h1>Recovered science.<br><em>Original forecasts preserved.</em></h1>
<p class="lede">Compare target-specific research leaders, examine the frozen seasons, and inspect original issued forecasts separately from retrospective replay. The latest recovered terminal evidence is dated November 12, 2026 at 02:08 UTC.</p>
